From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 13:50:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add live-catch loop steps 1-5: messages + perception->policy
 dry-run

New ROS 2 packages for the UR3e live closed-loop ball catch:

- ur3e_catch_msgs (rosidl/ament_cmake): BallState, CatchTelemetry.
- ur3e_live_catch (ament_python):
  - pure-logic modules (no rclpy/numpy): joint_order, ball_frame
    (frame-aware transform + velocity filter), observation (33-D builder),
    policy_runtime (torch/onnx lazy backends + obs scaler), action and
    safety (designed, not yet wired -> step 6);
  - rclpy nodes: float32_adapter, test_ball_node (publish_frame base|camera),
    live_catch_node (60 Hz DRY-RUN, no robot command);
  - config/live_catch.yaml, launch/test_dry_run.launch.py;
  - stdlib unit tests (19 passing): observation equivalence against recorded
    rollouts, ball_frame, action mapper, safety; torch-gated policy
    equivalence test (decides the SKRL scaler question on the ROS machine).

Docs: add ur3e_live_catch_implementation_status.md and link it from
docs/Context/synthese_projet.md.

